indi-stable-3rdparty-drivers (2.2.4.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package. Builds indi-3rdparty tag v2.2.4.1's drivers for the
    same 9 vendors indi-stable-3rdparty-libs bundles, with -DBUILD_LIBS=OFF
